# Issue #104: the crossed pattern, not obtainable by neighborhoods
# alone: a span-less "!!" vetoes every flow touching the four items, then
# one plain "!" per wanted pair shows ab and cd; ad and cb stay hidden.

process A
process B
process C
process D

A -> B ab
C -> D cd
A -> D ad
C -> B cb

!! A B C D
! A B
! C D
